      "title": "Hogs: futures above cash",
      "body": "- December hogs settled Wednesday at **$56.03**, up 0.4% from Tuesday's $55.80.\n- USDA AMS put national negotiated cash hogs at $43.25 carcass base on 3,605 head killed Nov 10; the pork cutout was $69.34.",
      "so_what": "Futures and cash are far apart this morning.",
