      "overnight_surprise": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Grains: corn flat, beans soft",
      "body": "- December corn is at **$4.48** overnight, unchanged from Wednesday's settle.\n- January soybeans are at $12.28¾, down 2 cents. USDA AMS had Gulf corn bids at 94 to 95 over December on Wednesday.",
